## 3. Compact Density Timeline

One thin row per item, no group gaps — fits 30+ rows in the same height. A roadmap
"heat strip" with a minimap for scrubbing. For concepts with *many* dated instances.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ All work (47)                                       [ Fit ▾ ]   [ Compact �... │
├────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Design sys ┃ ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░                                          ┊           │
│ Onboarding ┃      ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓                                     ┊           │
│ API gatewy ┃          ▓▓▓▓▓░░░░░                                  ┊           │
│ Search     ┃              ▓▓▓░░░░░░░                              ┊           │
│ Billing v2 ┃                       ░░░░░░░░░                      ┊           │
│ Mobile     ┃                            ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░                ┊           │
│ Beta ◆     ┃                                       ◆              ┊           │
│ SSO        ┃                                          ░░░░░░░     ┊           │
│  …39 more  ┃                                                      ┊           │
├────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ minimap ▏▁▂▃▅▇█▇▅▃▂▁▁▂▃▂▁  [▒▒▒▒░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░]  ◀ drag to scrub ▶          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Data:** same spans, row height ~50% of classic; labels truncated, full on hover.
- **Config:** density toggle; minimap shows item-count-over-time + viewport window.
- **Best for:** dense backlogs / large concepts where classic lanes overflow.

