## 4. Dependency / Critical-Path

Bars plus connector arrows; the critical path is highlighted and slack is dimmed.
Answers "what's blocking what" rather than just "what's when".

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Launch plan — critical path 31d                          [ Deps: on ▾ ] [Day▾]│
├──────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                  │  W1      W2      W3      W4      W5      W6     ┊ now       │
│ Spec             │  ███┓                                          ┊           │
│ Design           │     ┗━▶███████┓                                ┊           │
│ Build API        │             ┗━▶█████████┓                      ┊           │
│ Build UI         │             ┗━▶▒▒▒▒▒▒┄┄┄┄┊  (3d slack)         ┊           │
│ Integrate        │                        ┗━▶██████┓              ┊           │
│ Launch ◆         │                                 ┗━▶◆           ┊           │
└──────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
   █ critical path   ▒ has slack   ┄ free float   ━▶ depends-on
```

- **Data:** needs a relation/dependency field (`dependsOn`); compute longest path.
- **Config:** `dependencyField`; toggle arrows; auto-highlight critical chain.
- **Best for:** projects where sequencing risk matters; fewer, well-linked items.

