## Quick comparison

| # | Direction          | Date precision | Density   | Killer use-case            |
|---|--------------------|----------------|-----------|----------------------------|
| 1 | Classic swimlane   | exact          | medium    | general "what's when"      |
| 2 | Now/Next/Later     | bucketed       | low       | exec roadmap, fuzzy dates  |
| 3 | Compact density    | exact          | very high | large backlogs             |
| 4 | Dependency / CP    | exact          | low–med   | sequencing & blockers      |
| 5 | Resource load      | exact          | medium    | capacity / staffing        |

**Suggestion:** ship #1 as the refined default and add #2/#5 as `display` modes —
both reuse the existing span computation, only the layout changes.
